[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:A Bad Cold]
[00:00.72]Lesson 61 | 第61课
[00:02.71]A bad cold | 重感冒
[00:05.34]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:10.60]What is good news for Jimmy? | 对吉米来说什么是好消息？
[00:15.38]Where's Jimmy? | 吉米在哪里？
[00:17.92]He's in bed. | 他在床上。
[00:20.22]What's the matter with him? | 他怎么了？
[00:22.74]He feels ill. | 他感觉不舒服。
[00:25.31]He looks ill. | 他看起来不舒服。
[00:27.64]We must call the doctor. | 我们必须叫医生。
[00:31.04]Yes, we must. | 是的，我们必须。
[00:33.52]Can you remember the doctor's telephone number? | 你记得医生的电话号码吗？
[00:38.35]Yes. It's 09754. | 是的。是09754。
[00:44.93]Open your mouth, Jimmy. | 张开你的嘴，吉米。
[00:48.22]Show me your tongue. Say, 'Ah'. | 给我看看你的舌头。说，“啊”。
[00:52.44]What's the matter with him, doctor? | 医生，他怎么了？
[00:56.60]He has a bad cold, Mr. Williams, so he must stay in bed for a week. | 他得了重感冒，威廉姆斯先生，所以他必须卧床一周。
[01:04.72]That's good news for Jimmy. | 那对吉米来说是个好消息。
[01:08.95]Good news? Why? | 好消息？为什么？
[01:11.98]Because he doesn't like school! | 因为他不喜欢上学！